# Sky to Porch WebMCP — optional server-side configuration
#
# Deterministic development, fixtures, and most tests require no credentials.
# Copy this file to .env.local only when a source integration needs a key.
# Never commit .env.local or expose credentials through NEXT_PUBLIC_*.

# NASA FIRMS MAP_KEY enables global VIIRS active-fire retrieval for selected
# areas outside NOAA HMS coverage. Without it, that path fails closed with an
# explicit unavailable or unsupported result; it never switches to fixtures.
# FIRMS_MAP_KEY=replace-with-registered-map-key

# Optional paid explanation providers are not required by the WebMCP evidence
# path. If one is introduced later, its server-only variables and abuse
# controls must be documented here at the same time as the verified adapter.

# NODE_ENV is set by Next.js.
